WEBVTT

00:11:27.583 --> 00:11:31.768
They're using AI to make
aquaculture sustainable.

00:11:31.792 --> 00:11:34.476
They're finding ways
to eliminate food waste.

00:11:34.500 --> 00:11:35.768
They are scaling up

00:11:35.792 --> 00:11:38.434
conservation agriculture
and managed grazing.

00:11:38.458 --> 00:11:40.226
And they're reviving ancient plants,

00:11:40.250 --> 00:11:42.934
and they're recycling
sewage and gray water

00:11:42.958 --> 00:11:45.625
to develop a drought-proof water supply.

00:11:46.625 --> 00:11:48.351
The upshot is this:

00:11:48.375 --> 00:11:53.434
Human innovation that marries
old and new approaches to food production

00:11:53.458 --> 00:11:57.393
can, and I believe, will
usher in this third way

00:11:57.417 --> 00:12:01.125
and redefine sustainable food
on a grand scale.